   "id": "accel-0090",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 90,
   "y": 1436,
   "width": 860.25,
   "height": 113.75,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Seller recruitment. Attestation asks providers to do work before the rate is famous.\nMitigations, each one a playbook already run:\n\u00b7 the one-day integration path (Flare DevRel: 8 months of oracle integration support)\n\u00b7 cohort-first targeting with direct access (LNMHacks: USD 7,000 in protocol partnerships)\n\u00b7 sequence mainnet history BEFORE the hardest asks: recruit with a track record, not a promise\nPlatform timelines (SCP, CCTP, Discovery on Arc) are Circle's clock: adopt when available, fallbacks rehearsed.\nBehind at week 4 shows in the receipts, and the plan re-scopes WITH the Circle team, changelog attached.",
   "originalText": "Seller recruitment. Attestation asks providers to do work before the rate is famous.\nMitigations, each one a playbook already run:\n\u00b7 the one-day integration path (Flare DevRel: 8 months of oracle integration support)\n\u00b7 cohort-first targeting with direct access (LNMHacks: USD 7,000 in protocol partnerships)\n\u00b7 sequence mainnet history BEFORE the hardest asks: recruit with a track record, not a promise\nPlatform timelines (SCP, CCTP, Discovery on Arc) are Circle's clock: adopt when available, fallbacks rehearsed.\nBehind at week 4 shows in the receipts, and the plan re-scopes WITH the Circle team, changelog attached.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "autoResize": true,
   "containerId": null,
   "baseline": 12.5
  },
