   "id": "accel-0093",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1200,
   "y": 1436,
   "width": 914.5,
   "height": 81.25,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "COMMITTED (mine to ship): hourly prints since launch-day access \u00b7 the one-day path + SDK published\n\u00b7 books open under a public depth policy \u00b7 a dependent PR written + offered \u00b7 methodology v1.0 under change-control\nTARGETED (depends on others): sellers bar 5, stretch 10 \u00b7 payers bar 2, stretch 5 \u00b7 the dependent in review + settling\nWhatever the targets read on the day is what gets presented.\nEvery number re-measured by verify_claims: the build fails when a claim and reality disagree",
   "originalText": "COMMITTED (mine to ship): hourly prints since launch-day access \u00b7 the one-day path + SDK published\n\u00b7 books open under a public depth policy \u00b7 a dependent PR written + offered \u00b7 methodology v1.0 under change-control\nTARGETED (depends on others): sellers bar 5, stretch 10 \u00b7 payers bar 2, stretch 5 \u00b7 the dependent in review + settling\nWhatever the targets read on the day is what gets presented.\nEvery number re-measured by verify_claims: the build fails when a claim and reality disagree",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "lineHeight": 1.3,
   "autoResize": true,
   "containerId": null,
   "baseline": 12.5
  }
